### TallyVel — Authentication & Authorization demo (VS Code "REST Client" extension)
###
### Before you start:
###   1. dotnet user-secrets set "Jwt:SigningKey" "<a random value of 32+ characters>" --project Api
###   2. dotnet ef database update --project Infrastructure --startup-project Api
###   3. dotnet run --project Api --launch-profile https      (trust the dev cert once: dotnet dev-certs https --trust)
###   4. VS Code settings: "rest-client.rememberCookiesForSubsequentRequests": false
###      (the refresh cookie is Secure + Path=/api/v1/auth, so this script passes it by hand — that is
###      also how we replay an OLD cookie further down).
###   5. Re-running? Change @runId so the emails are new.
###
### Run the requests top to bottom with "Send Request".

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7019
@runId = demo1
@password = correct-horse-battery

### 1. No token at all -> 401 problem+json (secure by default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stokvels

### 2. Register three users -> 201 (id, email, name only — never the hash)
# @name regLerato
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lerato.{{runId}}@example.com", "password": "{{password}}", "fullName": "Lerato" }

###
# @name regThabo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "thabo.{{runId}}@example.com", "password": "{{password}}", "fullName": "Thabo" }

###
# @name regSipho
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "sipho.{{runId}}@example.com", "password": "{{password}}", "fullName": "Sipho" }

### 3. Duplicate email in a different case, with spaces -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "  LERATO.{{runId}}@Example.com ", "password": "{{password}}", "fullName": "Lerato Again" }

### 4. Password shorter than 12 characters -> 400 validation problem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "short.{{runId}}@example.com", "password": "too-short", "fullName": "Short" }

### 5. Log in all three: the access token is in the body, the refresh token only in the cookie
# @name loginLerato
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lerato.{{runId}}@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
# @name loginThabo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "thabo.{{runId}}@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
# @name loginSipho
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "sipho.{{runId}}@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 6a. Wrong password -> 401 "Invalid email or password."
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lerato.{{runId}}@example.com", "password": "this-is-not-the-password" }

### 6b. Unknown email -> the SAME 401, so the API does not reveal which emails exist
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nobody.{{runId}}@example.com", "password": "this-is-not-the-password" }

### 7. Lerato creates a stokvel and becomes its Chairperson (cycle 2 = Monthly)
# @name createStokvel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stokvels
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLerato.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Demo Stokvel", "contributionAmountCents": 10000, "cycle": 2, "creatorId": "{{regLerato.response.body.id}}" }

### 8. Lerato adds Thabo as a Member (role 0 = Member, 1 = Treasurer, 2 = Chairperson)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stokvels/{{createStokvel.response.body.id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLerato.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "{{regThabo.response.body.id}}", "role": 0 }

### 9. Lerato (Chairperson) opens a cycle -> 201
# @name openCycle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stokvels/{{createStokvel.response.body.id}}/cycles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLerato.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "label": "2026-10" }

### 10. Thabo (Member) records his contribution -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stokvels/{{createStokvel.response.body.id}}/contributions
Authorization: Bearer {{loginThabo.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{runId}}-thabo-2026-10
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberUserId": "{{regThabo.response.body.id}}", "cycle": "2026-10", "amountCents": 10000 }

### 11a. Payout as Sipho (NOT a member) -> 404: the API does not confirm the stokvel exists
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stokvels/{{createStokvel.response.body.id}}/cycles/{{openCycle.response.body.id}}/payout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSipho.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipientUserId": "{{regLerato.response.body.id}}" }

### 11b. Payout as Thabo (member, but only a Member) -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stokvels/{{createStokvel.response.body.id}}/cycles/{{openCycle.response.body.id}}/payout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginThabo.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipientUserId": "{{regLerato.response.body.id}}" }

### 11c. Payout as Lerato (Chairperson) -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stokvels/{{createStokvel.response.body.id}}/cycles/{{openCycle.response.body.id}}/payout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLerato.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipientUserId": "{{regLerato.response.body.id}}" }

### 12. Refresh with Lerato's login cookie -> 200 and a NEW cookie (rotation)
# @name refresh1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Cookie: {{loginLerato.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### 13. Replay the OLD cookie (already used) -> 401, and the whole login family is revoked
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Cookie: {{loginLerato.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### 14. Even the NEW cookie is now dead -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Cookie: {{refresh1.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### 15. Logout twice -> 204 both times (idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Cookie: {{loginThabo.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Cookie: {{loginThabo.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### 16. Refresh after logout -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Cookie: {{loginThabo.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}
